# Applies after 0066 (the tree with 0010..0066 applied). UNTESTED ON DEVICE: compiled (dotnet build, ios-arm64, Release: rc 0, no error, 39 warnings: the 47 of the 0066 tree minus the 8 of the four obsolete-initialiser sites that now go through
# one factory; none is new) and the pure classes run in a host harness (a net console program built from the real source text of GameAppImportFolder.cs, GameAppImport.cs and the 0064 / 0065 classes: 253 checks, the 0066 ones kept, 35 mutations
# of the classes each caught); no iPhone run. Measured and assumed are told apart below.
